@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+## Context
+Single-file library with no dependencies; `applyPatch` returns new documents without mutating inputs.
+
+## Decisions
+- Implement the RFC pseudocode recursively. Plain object = non-null, non-array object.
+- Build results with fresh objects (copy of target members); results never share mutable structure with the patch: patch values are deep-copied (with nulls stripped from objects).
+- Use `Object.defineProperty`-safe assignment for own keys (so `__proto__` is an ordinary key) and own-property checks.
+- Never throws: any JSON input is valid.
