+## Why
+Some clients send partial updates in the simpler JSON Merge Patch format (RFC 7386); the library only supports RFC 6902 JSON Patch.
+
+## What Changes
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386.
+- Document it in the README.
+
+## Capabilities
+### New Capabilities
+- `merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+None.
+
+## Impact
+`src/index.ts`, `test/`, `README.md`. No dependencies, no breaking changes.
